    "text": "Hi there,\n\nStart with a job you want more of.\n\nWhat does the customer pay? What does it directly cost you to deliver that job?\n\nSubtract the direct costs. What remains is contribution before overhead and taxes, not net profit.\n\nThat number makes the marketing decision more useful. Bring it to the fit review so we can discuss the campaign against your actual business.\n\nJob price − direct delivery costs = contribution before overhead and taxes.\n\nStart my fit review: https://www.theleadflowpro.com/agency/start?plan=recommended&utm_source=resend&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=meta_sales_daily30_v1&utm_content=day05_job_contribution\n\nRyan Nichols\nThe LeadFlow Pro\n\nThe LeadFlow Pro\n2800 Gilmer Rd Suite 106, Longview, TX 75604\nYou requested information from The LeadFlow Pro and agreed to email follow-up.\n\nUnsubscribe from follow-up emails. No login required: {{{UNSUBSCRIBE_LINK}}}"
