    "text": "Hi there,\n\nYou sent information. The person went quiet.\n\nA useful follow-up asks something specific: what work do they need done, where is the job, or what is holding up the decision?\n\nKeep the message short enough to answer. Give them a clear next step.\n\nThat kind of follow-up belongs in the customer path. Let’s review how your business handles an inquiry after the first response.\n\nExample: “What is the main thing you need to know before we set a time?”\n\nStart my fit review: https://www.theleadflowpro.com/agency/start?plan=recommended&utm_source=resend&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=meta_sales_daily30_v1&utm_content=day13_useful_follow_up\n\nRyan Nichols\nThe LeadFlow Pro\n\nThe LeadFlow Pro\n2800 Gilmer Rd Suite 106, Longview, TX 75604\nYou requested information from The LeadFlow Pro and agreed to email follow-up.\n\nUnsubscribe from follow-up emails. No login required: {{{UNSUBSCRIBE_LINK}}}"
